# Turborepo workspace artifacts.
# Depth-independent so new workspaces (apps/*, packages/*, …) are covered
# without editing this file. Scoped to src/typescript by virtue of location.
**/node_modules/
**/.turbo/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/storybook-static/
**/.lighthouseci/
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

*.log
.env
.env.local
.DS_Store
